!
! How many apps hold one capability (gatehouse_rules.h GR4), in Trebago:
! the exact sum of one flag per app, 1 when that app may use it, 0 when
! not. A flag that is no flag is added as it is, where KRON holds it
! inside 0..1, so the two disagree and the count is held.
trebago holders
  in  held(n)
  out holders
  holders = sum(i, held(i))
end
